      "jp": "俺の顔を覚えているか、小僧。\n貴様らに野望を打ち砕かれ、人間大砲として、\n夜の海へ放たれた。",
      "jp_sha256": "0151914a0fe8d075dfd1ecfea03ee612e250ea9e94d0bd9d964c98394f10973e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "내 얼굴을 기억하나, 꼬맹이.\n너희에게 야망이 꺾여 인간 대포로\n밤바다에 날아갔지.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b012-20261109-same-model-pass2-aaabc0ee",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bc8f6659832bb1d24d0cda2ab917aa478b8d6599afa4a6f4c50295d92f83e14c:000000_-3148431896113188195:g0:r27",
      "row_index_0based": 27,
      "serialized_row_index": 27,
      "source_cells": [
